# The deploy target: copy this file to .env (which git ignores) and fill it in
# (doc/SETUP.md). utils/deploy.sh, utils/pull-backups.sh and utils/install-official-sets.ts
# read it, so the repository names no host, login or path.

# The SSH destination: a login on the server whose key you hold, and which may run docker
DEPLOY_HOST=you@csbweb.example.org

# The stack's folder on the server, absolute: a ~ would be expanded on your own machine
DEPLOY_DIR=/home/you/csbweb

# Where utils/pull-backups.sh copies the server's backups, ../backups/csbweb beside the
# checkout when unset
# BACKUP_PULL_DIR=
